---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="LokiProxy 代理深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/lokiproxy.webp`} alt="LokiProxy" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-1">LokiProxy 深度评测</h1>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">3500 万+ 住宅 IP，Premium 低至 $0.48/GB</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">评分概览</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">综合评分</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">IP 纯净度</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">8.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">性价比</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">8.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">产品多样性</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">6.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">品牌知名度</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">产品概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          LokiProxy 是全球住宅代理服务商，拥有 3500 万+ 住宅 IP，覆盖 190+ 个国家和地区。提供轮转住宅代理 Basic/Premium、不限流量住宅代理、短期住宅 IP 和静态住宅 ISP 代理四种产品线。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Premium 轮转住宅代理低至 $0.48/GB，Basic 版 $2.5/GB 起。支持 ASN 级精确定位，国家/州/城市三级定位。HTTP 和 SOCKS5 协议，粘性会话最长 180 分钟。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Premium 流量永不过期。支持 CDKey 分配和转售功能。通过 Telegram 客服提供免费试用。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">核心特性详解</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">$0.48/GB 极致低价</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Premium 大容量套餐低至 $0.48/GB，50TB 套餐价格全行业最低之一。Basic 版 $2.5/GB 适合入门，Premium 流量永不过期。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">3500 万+ IP 190+ 国家</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">35M+ 真实住宅 IP 资源池，190+ 国家覆盖。99.8% IP 纯净率。国家/州/城市三级定位，ASN 级 ISP 精确定位。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">四种产品线</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">轮转住宅 Basic/Premium（按量计费）、不限流量住宅（按时计费）、短期住宅 IP（按 IP 计费，积分永不过期）、静态住宅 ISP（专属 IP 不限流量）。覆盖全场景。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Flexible Session Control</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">粘性会话最长 180 分钟，或每次请求自动轮转。无限并发会话和线程。HTTP 和 SOCKS5 协议全支持。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">CDKey 分配和转售</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Premium 计划支持 CDKey 分配和转售功能。方便代理商管理和分发资源。灵活控制成本和使用权限。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Telegram 客服 + 免费试用</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">通过 Telegram @lokiproxy 联系客服获取免费试用。支持信用卡支付。99.9% 在线率保障。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">适用场景详细分析</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">1. 大规模数据采集</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">Premium $0.48/GB 适合千万级页面采集。ASN 定位获取特定运营商数据。无限并发确保采集效率。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2. 跨境电商多店铺运营</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">静态住宅 ISP 代理 100% 专属 IP。90 天长期租赁。不限流量。适合 Amazon、Shopee 等平台多店铺管理。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">3. 社媒运营</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">住宅 IP 纯净率高，适合 TikTok、Facebook 等平台账号管理。粘性会话 180 分钟保障长期运营任务。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">4. 代理商转售</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">CDKey 分配和转售功能专为代理商设计。Premium 计划灵活管理子用户和资源分配。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>Premium 低至 $0.48/GB</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>3500 万+ IP，190+ 国家</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>四种产品线覆盖全场景</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>ASN 级精准定位</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>CDKey 转售功能</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>Premium 流量永不过期</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>品牌知名度有限</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>Basic 计划 30 天有效</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>免费试用需联系客服</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无公开审计信息</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          LokiProxy 以 $0.48/GB 的 Premium 价格在住宅代理市场中形成了极致的性价比优势。3500 万+ IP 和 190+ 国家的资源池满足大规模采集需求，ASN 级定位提供了更精准的 ISP 控制。</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          四种产品线的设计覆盖了从个人到企业、从按量到不限流量的全场景需求。CDKey 转售功能为代理商提供了独特价值。</p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          综合评估，LokiProxy 获得 7.0 分，特别推荐给需要大规模、低成本住宅代理的数据采集团队和代理商。</p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://lokiproxy.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 LokiProxy 官网
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>